[ti:You're Not Mine]
[ar:Synapse]
[al:Single]
[length:02:56]

[00:00.00][Intro]
[00:01.48](You're not mine, no... mine)
[00:06.58]Hooo hooo... my...

[00:12.00][Verse 1]
[00:12.50]Today, you're just a memory
[00:16.00]An echo from the past
[00:20.00]A love so cherished, silenced at last
[00:26.64]I built you a pedestal
[00:30.30]In my mind, you were immortal

[00:34.00][Chorus]
[00:34.82]You're not mine
[00:37.16]And I lived just to love you
[00:38.22]You're not mine
[00:40.60]But I was always yours
[00:42.00]You're not mine
[00:44.46]I tattooed your name on me
[00:48.78]But you're not mine

[00:54.00][Verse 2]
[00:54.30]You were the love I tried to keep
[00:57.00]Today, the ache I try to delete
[01:01.30]Your name is eternalized on my skin
[01:07.54]A love that was forever declared
[01:10.20]And even if I try, it cannot be changed

[01:14.00][Chorus]
[01:14.52]You're not mine
[01:16.50]And I lived just to love you
[01:18.30]You're not mine
[01:19.86]But I was always yours
[01:21.46]You're not mine
[01:23.66]I tattooed your name on me
[01:28.66]But you're not mine

[01:41.00][Bridge]
[01:41.36]The long conversations
[01:45.66]The choices that we made
[01:48.22]The plans that we dreamed of
[01:51.78]The future we let fade
[01:55.52]It never allowed for even one single kiss
[01:59.78]To you, I'm just a faint memory
[02:03.78]Just someone that you once liked

[02:07.50][Chorus]
[02:07.94]You're not mine
[02:12.88]But I was always yours
[02:15.12]You're not mine
[02:17.20]I tattooed your name on me
[02:21.84]But you're not mine

[02:24.00][Outro]
[02:24.36]I need to forget you
[02:26.18]But it's easier for my soul to die
[02:29.64]And you're not mine
[02:31.16]And you'll never be
[02:32.62]But I'll always be stuck on "what if..."
[02:35.76]You still burn deep inside of me
[02:43.36]But you're not mine
[02:50.20]You're not mine...